Document.description_en:
In response to a major flooding event that occurred in 2022, Naicatchewenin First Nation is proposing the repair of the damages caused by the event, reinforcement of the shorelines of Rainy Lake and Footprint River adjacent to the community, as well as improvements to the community&#39;s flood management infrastructure. Project activities include:


	the installation of rip rap along shorelines that were eroded to stabilize and prevent further erosion from future flooding events;
	the replacement of culverts to larger culverts that can drain higher water volumes more efficiently;
	improvements to the main community road that was flooded over by raising and resurfacing to ensure egress/access to the community;
	replace two community docks that were taken away by floodwater;
	and re-gravelling of areas that were washed away.


These repairs and improvements will ensure the community is better prepared for future flooding events that are occurring on a more regular basis and will remain accessible during emergency circumstances.

Document.description_fr:
En r&eacute;ponse &agrave; une inondation majeure survenue en 2022, la Premi&egrave;re nation Naicatchewenin propose de r&eacute;parer les dommages caus&eacute;s par l&#39;inondation, de renforcer les rives du lac Rainy et de la rivi&egrave;re Footprint adjacentes &agrave; la communaut&eacute;, ainsi que d&#39;am&eacute;liorer l&#39;infrastructure de gestion des inondations de la communaut&eacute;. Les activit&eacute;s du projet comprennent:


	l&#39;installation d&#39;un enrochement le long des berges &eacute;rod&eacute;es afin de stabiliser et de pr&eacute;venir toute nouvelle &eacute;rosion lors de futures inondations;
	le remplacement des ponceaux par des ponceaux plus grands qui peuvent drainer des volumes d&#39;eau plus importants de mani&egrave;re plus efficace;
	l&#39;am&eacute;lioration de la route principale de la communaut&eacute; qui a &eacute;t&eacute; inond&eacute;e par le rehaussement et le resurfa&ccedil;age afin d&#39;assurer la sortie et l&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la communaut&eacute;;
	le remplacement de deux quais communautaires qui ont &eacute;t&eacute; emport&eacute;s par les eaux de crue;
	et en refaisant le nivellement des zones qui ont &eacute;t&eacute; emport&eacute;es par les eaux.


Ces r&eacute;parations et am&eacute;liorations permettront &agrave; la communaut&eacute; d&#39;&ecirc;tre mieux pr&eacute;par&eacute;e aux futures inondations qui se produisent de plus en plus r&eacute;guli&egrave;rement et de rester accessible en cas d&#39;urgence.

